infinite-patch 1
# Footwork Rapid Fire Percussive Stab Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 55
  i note1 55
  i note2 60
  i note3 62
  i note4 55
  i note5 58
  i note6 62
  i note7 65
  i note8 55
  i note9 55
  i note10 60
  i note11 67
  i note12 58
  i note13 60
  i note14 62
  i note15 65
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
  b en2 1
  b en3 1
  b en4 1
  b en5 1
  b en6 1
  b en7 1
